{"id":"c4e71acf1bfafb59","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hif-truth-table.md","title":"超免疫自由度中的 tt 归约","display":"thm-hif-truth-table — 超免疫自由度中的 tt 归约","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hif-truth-table","aliases":["20-thm-hif-truth-table"],"display":"thm-hif-truth-table — 超免疫自由度中的 tt 归约","chapter":"5","section":"5.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 5.6.4","source_pdf_pages":[160],"source_printed_pages":[125],"depends_on":["[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[20-df-truth-table]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-thm-truth-table]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hif-truth-table"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hif-truth-table</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-truth-table — 超免疫自由度中的 tt 归约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.6.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ce1554622515cdf\" href=\"?note=8ce1554622515cdf\" title=\"20-thm-truth-table\">20-thm-truth-table</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\">\\(\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TA\">\\(B\\le_TA\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ce1554622515cdf\" href=\"?note=8ce1554622515cdf\" title=\"20-thm-truth-table\">20-thm-truth-table</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\\)</span> 是集合之间的 truth-table 归约关系，见上游 truth-table。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nB\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nB\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>oracle 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的停止时间是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算全函数，故有普通可计算时间界，有限例外也可调整。在任何 oracle 下按该时限模拟，超时给默认答案，得到总泛函并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；应用 Nerode 定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.4；印刷页 125；PDF 第 160 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"8ce1554622515cdf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-truth-table]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-truth-table]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-truth-table]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"8ce1554622515cdf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","locati